1-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-18T09:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T16:09:55Z","closed_at":"2026-05-18T16:09:54Z","assignee":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.7.beta (321b8c944)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (321b8c944) - macOS Tahoe (26.4.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 (Apple9) - Apple M3 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n`EditorExportPlugin._export_end()` is being invoked prematurely during the iOS export pipeline.\n\nGiven the following export plugin implementation:\n\n```gdscript\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nvar ios_export_plugin: IosExportPlugin\n\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\tios_export_plugin = IosExportPlugin.new()\n\tadd_export_plugin(ios_export_plugin)\n\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\tremove_export_plugin(ios_export_plugin)\n\tios_export_plugin = null\n\n\nclass IosExportPlugin extends EditorExportPlugin:\n\tfunc _supports_platform(platform: EditorExportPlatform) -> bool:\n\t\treturn platform is EditorExportPlatformIOS\n\n\n\tfunc _get_name() -> String:\n\t\treturn \"my_export_plugin\"\n\n\n\tfunc _export_begin(_features: PackedStringArray, _is_debug: bool, path: String, _flags: int) -> void:\n\t\tpush_warning(\"_export_begin: %s\" % path)\n\n\n\tfunc _begin_customize_resources(_platform: EditorExportPlatform, _features: PackedStringArray) -> bool:\n\t\tpush_warning(\"_begin_customize_resources\")\n\t\treturn false\n\n\n\tfunc _end_generate_apple_embedded_project(path: String, _will_build_archive: bool) -> void:\n\t\tpush_warning(\"_end_generate_apple_embedded_project: %s\" % path)\n\n\n\tfunc _export_end() -> void:\n\t\tpush_warning(\"_export_end\")\n```\n\nan iOS export produces the following log output:\n\n```\n  WARNING: core/variant/variant_utility.cpp:1033 - _export_begin: ../../../Xcode/test/export_bug_1/ExportBug1.ipa\n  WARNING: core/variant/variant_utility.cpp:1033 - _export_end\n  WARNING: core/variant/variant_utility.cpp:1033 - _begin_customize_resources\nStatic framework: libgodot.ios.debug.xcframework\nUnzipping...\nREAD: MoltenVK.xcframework/\nREAD: godot_apple_embedded/\n...\nExporting launch screen storyboard\nExporting additional assets\n  WARNING: core/variant/variant_utility.cpp:1033 - _end_generate_apple_embedded_project: ../../../Xcode/test/export_bug_1/ExportBug1.ipa\nCommand line invocation:\n    /Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/xcodebuild -project ...\n...\n```\n\nThe observed callback sequence is:\n\n```\n_export_begin\n_export_end\n_begin_customize_resources\n_end_generate_apple_embedded_project\n```\n\nThis ordering appears to violate the expected export lifecycle semantics. Specifically, `_export_end()` is being called before the export process has actually completed, despite additional export customization and embedded project generation stages continuing afterward.\n\nThe expected lifecycle ordering should instead be:\n\n```\n_export_begin\n_begin_customize_resources\n_end_generate_apple_embedded_project\n_export_end\n```\n\nFrom an API contract perspective, `_export_end()` should represent the terminal stage of the export pipeline and should not execute until all platform-specific post-processing, embedded project generation, asset export steps, and external build system invocations have completed. Calling it earlier makes it unreliable for cleanup, finalization, deferred file operations, or any logic that depends on the export artifacts being fully generated and finalized.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open attached MRP\n- Export to iOS\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27952394/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url"